<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Facebook OAuth Setup Guide - Atomecom</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --fb-blue: #1877F2;
            --text-dark: #2d3436;
            --text-muted: #636e72;
            --bg-step: #ffffff;
            --warning-bg: #fff4e6;
            --warning-border: #ff922b;
            --info-bg: #e7f3ff;
            --info-border: #1877F2;
            --deprecated-bg: #f1f2f6;
        }

        body { 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            color: var(--text-dark); 
            background: #f0f2f5; 
            padding: 2rem; 
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container { 
            max-width: 850px; 
            margin: auto; 
            background: white; 
            padding: 2.5rem; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); 
        }

        h1 { color: var(--fb-blue); border-bottom: 2px solid #eef2f5; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0; }
        
        .back-link { 
            display: inline-block; 
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem; 
            color: var(--fb-blue); 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .step-card {
            background: var(--bg-step);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }

        .step-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .step-number {
            background: var(--fb-blue);
            color: white;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .step-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; }

        .step-content { padding-left: 3.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .alert-card { border-left: 5px solid; }
        .alert-info { background: var(--info-bg); border-color: var(--info-border); }
        .alert-warning { background: var(--warning-bg); border-color: var(--warning-border); }
        .alert-deprecated { background: var(--deprecated-bg); border-color: #747d8c; }

        code { background: #f1f3f5; padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; color: #d63031; font-family: monospace; }
        pre { background: #2d3436; color: #74b9ff; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto; }
        
        .guide-link-alt { color: var(--fb-blue); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
        .guide-link-alt:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/test-ui/facebook" class="back-link">← Back to Facebook Test UI</a>
        <h1>Facebook OAuth Configuration Guide</h1>
        
        <div class="steps-section">
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">Initialize App Creation</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>Visit <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/" target="_blank" class="guide-link-alt">Meta for Developers</a>. Click <b>"Create App"</b> and fill in your <b>App Name</b> and <b>Contact Email</b>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card alert-card alert-deprecated">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">Select Use Case (The "Other" Path)</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>Meta's UI is changing, follow this path to find the standard login:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Select <b>"Others"</b> at the bottom of the use case list.</li>
                        <li>On the next screen, scroll down and select <b>"Consumer"</b>.</li>
                        <li>Follow the prompts to finalize the creation. <i>(Note: This path is legacy and might be removed soon).</i></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card alert-card alert-info">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">App Settings > Basic</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>In the sidebar, navigate to <b>App Settings > Basic</b>:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>App Domains:</b> Enter your forwarded domain (e.g., <code>your-id.app.github.dev</code>).</li>
                        <li>Scroll to the bottom and click <b>"Add Platform"</b>.</li>
                        <li>Select <b>"Website"</b> and paste your forwarded URL into the <b>Site URL</b> field.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">Facebook Login > Settings</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>Under the <b>Facebook Login</b> product in the sidebar, go to <b>Settings</b>:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Valid OAuth Redirect URIs:</b> Paste your full forwarded link.</li>
                        <li>Toggle <b>"Login with the JavaScript SDK"</b> to <b>ON</b>.</li>
                        <li><b>Allowed Domains for the JavaScript SDK:</b> Paste your domain (e.g., <code>https://your-id.app.github.dev</code>).</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><b>Pro Tip:</b> Using <b>VS Code Port Forwarding</b> is highly recommended to handle HTTPS requirements during development.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card alert-card alert-warning">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">5</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">App Mode & Roles</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>While in <b>Development Mode</b>, you must manually authorize accounts:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Go to <b>App roles > Roles</b>.</li>
                        <li>Ensure your account is an <b>Administrator</b> or add <b>Testers</b>.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">6</div>
                    <h2 class="step-title">Environment Variables</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <p>Copy your <b>App ID</b> and update your <code>.env</code> file:</p>
                    <pre><code>FACEBOOK_APP_ID=your_app_id_here</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 12px; color: #b2bec3; text-align: center;">
            Atomecom Project - Developer Documentation
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>